            <h3>
              Garlic Shrimp
            </h3>

            <strong>
              $14
            </strong>

          </div>

          <p>
            Juicy shrimp, garlic butter,
            lemon and fresh herbs.
          </p>

        </div>

      </article>


      <article class="menu-card" data-category="mains">

        <div class="dish-image pasta">
          🍝
        </div>

        <div class="dish-content">

          <div class="dish-title">

            <h3>
              Truffle Pasta
            </h3>

            <strong>
              $18
            </strong>

          </div>

          <p>
            Fresh pasta, creamy parmesan sauce
            and aromatic truffle.
          </p>

        </div>

      </article>


      <article class="menu-card" data-category="mains">

        <div class="dish-image steak">
          🥩
        </div>

        <div class="dish-content">

          <div class="dish-title">

            <h3>
              Grilled Steak
            </h3>

            <strong>
              $26
            </strong>

          </div>

          <p>
            Grilled beef, roasted vegetables
