          </p>

        </div>

      </article>


      <article class="menu-card" data-category="pizza">

        <div class="dish-image chicken">
          🍕
        </div>

        <div class="dish-content">

          <div class="dish-title">

            <h3>
              Spicy Chicken Pizza
            </h3>

            <strong>
              $17
            </strong>

          </div>

          <p>
            Spiced chicken, mozzarella,
