          </p>

        </div>

      </article>


      <article class="menu-card" data-category="desserts">

        <div class="dish-image cheesecake">
          🍰
        </div>

        <div class="dish-content">

          <div class="dish-title">

            <h3>
              Berry Cheesecake
            </h3>

            <strong>
              $9
            </strong>

          </div>

          <p>
            Creamy cheesecake with fresh berries
            and berry sauce.
          </p>

        </div>

      </article>


      <article class="menu-card" data-category="drinks">

        <div class="dish-image drink">
          🥤
        </div>

        <div class="dish-content">

          <div class="dish-title">

            <h3>
              Sunset Cooler
            </h3>

            <strong>
              $7
            </strong>

          </div>

          <p>
            Citrus, berries, mint
            and sparkling water.
          </p>

        </div>

      </article>

    </div>

  </div>

</section>


<section class="about-section" id="about">

  <div class="container about-grid">

    <div class="about-visual">

      <div class="about-box">

        <span>
          EST.
        </span>

        <strong>
          2026
        </strong>

        <small>
          CAIRO
        </small>

      </div>

    </div>


    <div class="about-text">

      <p class="eyebrow">
        OUR STORY
      </p>

